Parse CSS easing functions exactly in transition and animation lists: the
cubic-bezier() and steps() functions, and the linear, ease, ease-in, ease-out,
ease-in-out, step-start and step-end keywords, with ease as the initial easing.
Commas and spaces inside a function no longer split the list, which rejected a
whole list naming cubic-bezier().

